.DS_Store
*.log
.claude/backlog/.lock/
.claude/backlog/claims/
# Sprint run logs, stage captures and the single-instance marker: machine-local provenance, never
# committed (0185). The captures are unfiltered stage output and this repo is public; LEDGER.md is
# the committed record. A committed marker would make every clone report a supervisor driving it.
.claude/backlog/runs/

# Machine-local list of internal organisation and client names (0143). NEVER COMMITTED:
# the names are the secret, so a committed enumeration would be the leak the guard exists to
# stop. tests/measurement.test.sh reads it if present and skips the check if absent.
.private-names
